    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit the ice in a fast-paced, physics-driven hockey simulation that puts you in complete control. Every pass, shot, and body check is powered by realistic physics, making each game unpredictable, skill-based, and endlessly replayable. Whether you're a die-hard hockey fan or just looking for a fun and competitive sports experience, this game delivers high-intensity action with fluid gameplay and dynamic mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-Based Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stick controls are designed to offer a high level of precision and depth, allowing you to execute skillful plays, react to dynamic puck physics, and outmaneuver your opponents with finesse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puck isn\u2019t just about skill - it\u2019s about working together to create game-changing moments. Whether you're threading a perfect pass through defenders, setting up a teammate for a one-timer, or executing a seamless give-and-go, teamwork is at the heart of every unforgettable play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great hockey team needs both fearless skaters and rock-solid goaltenders. Whether you thrive on the rush as a forward, dominate the blue line as a defenseman, or guard the net as a last line of defense, your role on the ice is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to hit the ice in a fast-paced, physics-driven hockey simulation that puts you in complete control. Every pass, shot, and body check is powered by realistic physics, making each game unpredictable, skill-based, and endlessly replayable. Whether you're a die-hard hockey fan or just looking for a fun and competitive sports experience, this game delivers high-intensity action with fluid gameplay and dynamic mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-Based Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stick controls are designed to offer a high level of precision and depth, allowing you to execute skillful plays, react to dynamic puck physics, and outmaneuver your opponents with finesse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/3ad3736830de57db2965399ed57503f0.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puck isn\u2019t just about skill - it\u2019s about working together to create game-changing moments. Whether you're threading a perfect pass through defenders, setting up a teammate for a one-timer, or executing a seamless give-and-go, teamwork is at the heart of every unforgettable play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/2a3564daa56df485016c7b9048d670f0.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/23a4c02eaab11c76b8d26792d8473c05.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great hockey team needs both fearless skaters and rock-solid goaltenders. Whether you thrive on the rush as a forward, dominate the blue line as a defenseman, or guard the net as a last line of defense, your role on the ice is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.poster.avif?t=1745441079\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.webm?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/0ae8c0e66bcfe49620c21dd51bb01320.mp4?t=1745441079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
